estos y ritmo del negocio.","ComprensiÃ³n de cÃ³mo equilibrar calidez con eficiencia de tiempo."],"redFlags":["Incapacidad para dar nombres de empresas o detalles creÃ­bles de su experiencia.","Preferencia excesiva por la lentitud en detrimento de la velocidad operativa requerida en un drive-thru."]},{"id":"q4","block":"block_2","text":"Escribiste que en una ocasiÃ³n 'my coworker and i were working by ourselves and our manager was on her lunch... my other coworker was overwhelmed so i jumped in the help her out'. CuÃ©ntame exactamente quÃ© tareas asumiste tÃº en ese momento, cÃ³mo se comunicaron verbalmente en el espacio de trabajo y cuÃ¡nto tiempo durÃ³ esa hora pico.","language":"es","purpose":"Verificar habilidades de trabajo en equipo bajo estrÃ©s en espacios compartidos estrechos.","listenFor":["Acciones prÃ¡cticas de apoyo cruzado y comunicaciÃ³n verbal constante ('a tus espaldas', 'yo paso', etc.).","Mentalidad colaborativa orientada a sacar la fila de clientes adelante."],"redFlags":["Tendencia a culpar al compaÃ±ero o quejarse de la ausencia del supervisor.","Falta de claridad en las tareas operativas ejecutadas."]},{"id":"q5","block":"block_3","text":"Imagine you are at Window A taking orders through the headset while handing a hot coffee to a driver. A customer asks for a customized iced latte with oat milk, extra caramel drizzle, and two raw sugars. How would you confirm the order and thank them quickly in English?","language":"en","purpose":"Evaluar la fluidez, terminologÃ­a bÃ¡sica de cafeterÃ­a y cortesÃ­a en inglÃ©s en un entorno de drive-thru dinÃ¡mico.","listenFor":["Clear pronunciation, natural tone, and quick repetition of drink details.","Polite, customer-focused phrasing like 'I got you', 'My pleasure', or 'Have a great day!'."],"redFlags":["Inability to form basic sentences or understand standard coffee modifications in English.","Freezing up or showing high anxiety when speaking English."]},{"id":"q6","block":"block_3","text":"In your screening you said you would apologize and remake a wrong drink right away. If an upset customer at the window says: 'I've been waiting 10 minutes and this is not what I ordered!', how do you de-escalate the situation in English in less than 30 seconds?","language":"en","purpose":"Comprobar el manejo de quejas y la habilidad de resoluciÃ³n rÃ¡pida de conflictos en inglÃ©s.","listenFor":["Calm de-escalation: sincere apology, immediate solution ('I will remake this for you right now'), and rapid execution.","Maintaining professional composure without getting defensive."],"redFlags":["Arguing with the customer or blaming other team members.","Lack of vocabulary in English to handle a dissatisfied customer."]},{"id":"q7","block":"block_4","text":"Mencionaste tu tÃ©cnica para memorizar el menÃº: 'I tend to remember things when i repeat and break it down to steps'. En Ellianos preparamos cafÃ©s, smoothies y bebidas Lotus Energy a gran velocidad. Â¿QuÃ© mÃ©todo especÃ­fico usas cuando tienes que aprenderte 20 recetas nuevas en tus primeros 3 dÃ­as de entrenamiento?","language":"es","purpose":"Evaluar la agilidad de aprendizaje y el compromiso con el estÃ¡ndar tÃ©cnico de calidad italiana de Ellianos.","listenFor":["HÃ¡bitos de estudio proactivos (fichas, repeticiÃ³n de recetas, toma de notas voluntaria).","DisposiciÃ³n para estudiar y repasar el menÃº antes o despuÃ©s del turno."],"redFlags":["Esperar aprender Ãºnicamente por inercia sin esfuerzo de memorizaciÃ³n.","DesinterÃ©s en la precisiÃ³n de las recetas y medidas."]},{"id":"q8","block":"block_4","text":"Afirmaste que un manager anterior 'gave me feedback about being more organized while handling multiple tasks'. Si durante una hora pico en el kiosco un lÃ­der de turno te corrige en voz alta la tÃ©cnica de vaporizado de leche frente a otros compaÃ±eros, Â¿cÃ³mo reaccionas en ese instante?","language":"es","purpose":"Verificar tolerancia a la crÃ­tica constructiva en tiempo real sin tomarla como ofensa personal.","listenFor":["Madurez emocional, aceptaciÃ³n inmediata de la correcciÃ³n ('entendido, lo corrijo ya').","ComprensiÃ³n de que el ritmo acelerado exige feedback directo e instantÃ¡neo."],"redFlags":["Actitud defensiva, susceptibilidad o frustraciÃ³n ante correcciones en vivo.","Tendencia a desmotivarse o bajar el ritmo si es corregida."]},{"id":"q9","block":"block_5","text":"Durante la entrevista virtual notamos en una de las respuestas de servicio un breve pegado de texto y cambios de pestaÃ±a. En Ellianos valoramos la honestidad por encima de todo: Â¿utilizaste alguna ayuda digital o buscador para formular tus respuestas, y quÃ© opinas de responder con tus propias palabras en el trabajo diario?","language":"es","purpose":"Evaluar la integridad y transparencia del candidato respecto a su prueba inicial sin acusar.","listenFor":["Respuesta honesta y tranquila reconociendo si consultÃ³ traductor o notas.","Defensa de su propia capacidad para comunicarse y trabajar de forma genuina."],"redFlags":["Nerviosismo extremo, mentiras evidentes o molestia ante la pregunta.","Inconsistencia total entre lo que escribiÃ³ y lo que puede expresar en persona."]},{"id":"q10","block":"block_5","text":"La nueva tienda de Lehigh Acres abre en octubre y requiere estar de pie 6 a 8 horas continuas, cargando cajas de leche o hielo de hasta 30 lbs en un kiosco compacto de 800 sq ft con 4 a 6 personas. Â¿Hay algÃºn factor fÃ­sico o de compromiso que debamos considerar antes de proceder con tu oferta?","language":"es","purpose":"Confirmar la resistencia fÃ­sica y el compromiso firme con el lanzamiento de la nueva tienda.","listenFor":["AceptaciÃ³n segura y entusiasta de las exigencias fÃ­sicas del puesto.","Entusiasmo genuino por formar parte de un equipo fundador de tienda nueva."],"redFlags":["ExpresiÃ³n de dudas sobre la exigencia fÃ­sica o el trabajo de pie prolongado.","Falta de interÃ©s o compromiso con la fecha de apertura en octubre."]}],"focusPoints":["Definir con precisiÃ³n absoluta la disponibilidad horaria semanal, resolviendo la discrepancia entre su horario inicial (Lunes a Viernes 10am-tarde) y su confirmaciÃ³n de aperturas 5:00 AM y fines de semana.","Validar experiencia operativa real y ritmo de trabajo en equipo bajo presiÃ³n en espacios reducidos (kiosco de 800 sq ft).","Evaluar fluidez verbal en inglÃ©s para toma de pedidos y servicio rÃ¡pido en ventanilla de doble carril.","Comprobar actitud receptiva al entrenamiento y compromiso a largo plazo con la apertura de la nueva sucursal en Lehigh Acres."]},"emailSent":true,"id":"55cda762-28ba-48fc-8306-8f2a163a84b2","candidateInfo":{"phone":"2392470988","name":"Yovana Garcia-Ruiz","email":"yovanalyalejandra@gmail.com"}},{"candidateInfo":{"phone":"239-834-3532","name":"VICTORIA N CRUZ-ORTIZ","email":"VictoriaNCruzortiz@gmail.com"},"messages":[{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"Hello! I am applying for the Barista position at the new Lehigh Acres location."}]},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"Hello Victoria! Welcome, and thank you for your interest in joining the Ellianos Coffee team at our brand-new Lehigh Acres location. We're very excited to speak with you today!\n\nBefore we get started, I want to share a few quick details about how this interview works:\n* The full interview consists of a maximum of **25 questions**, asked one at a time.\n* You can finish and submit your application at **any time** by clicking the **\"Submit\"** button on your screen.\n* Alternatively, you can simply tell me right here in the chat whenever you would like to wrap up.\n\nTo kick things off with a simple question: **What made you interested in applying for a Barista position with Ellianos Coffee today?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"I'm interested in the barista position because I enjoy meeting and helping people, and I think Elliano's coffee would be a great place to gain experience, learn new skills, and grow in a positive work environment."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":225328,"keystrokes":251,"maxInsertChunk":1,"responseDelayMs":127246,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":10,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"That's wonderful to hear, Victoria! A positive attitude and a passion for connecting with people are exactly what we look for.\n\nSince making people smile is such a big part of our drive-thru experience, **could you share an example of a timeâ€”either at work, school, or in your everyday lifeâ€”when you went out of your way to make someoneâ€™s day a little brighter or help someone out?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"One time at school, I noticed a classmate struggling to understand an assignment. I took time to explain it and helped them work through it without just giving them the answer. They were really appreciative, and it made me feel good knowing I was able to make things easier for them."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":336009,"keystrokes":371,"maxInsertChunk":5,"responseDelayMs":71062,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":9,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"That shows great patience and a natural willingness to support those around youâ€”qualities that make for a fantastic team player!\n\nAt Ellianos, our double drive-thru operates out of a compact, 800-square-foot kiosk with a lean, close-knit team. Because our team is small on each shift, being dependable and arriving on time every day is essentialâ€”even one absence or late arrival can impact the entire flow of service.\n\n**Do you have reliable transportation to get to and from the Lehigh Acres location consistently, and how do you ensure you stay punctual for your commitments?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"Yes, I have reliable transportation to and from the Lehigh Acres location. I make sure to plan ahead, leave with enough time to consider traffic, and use reminders so I can consistently arrive on time."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":285026,"keystrokes":229,"maxInsertChunk":1,"responseDelayMs":87020,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":7,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"Planning ahead and building in buffer time is a great habit to have!\n\nWorking in our 800-square-foot drive-thru kiosk is a very active, hands-on role. Our baristas are on their feet moving quickly for several hours at a time, bending, reaching, and regularly lifting items like 30-pound crates of milk, ice buckets, or syrup cases. \n\n**How comfortable are you with this level of physical activity, and how do you usually keep your energy up during busy, demanding days?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"I'm comfortable with staying active and on my feet. I keep my energy up by staying hydrated, staying focused, and keeping a positive attitude throughout the day"}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":178742,"keystrokes":221,"maxInsertChunk":4,"responseDelayMs":57332,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":9,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"That positive mindset and endurance will definitely serve you well here!\n\nOur motto at Ellianos is *\"Italian Quality at America's Pace,\"* which means our baristas often have to balance speed with high attention to detailâ€”like remembering custom drink modifications while chatting warmly with a guest and listening to incoming orders over the headset.\n\n**Can you share a specific example of a time when you had to juggle multiple tasks or remember lots of details at once under a time crunch? How did you keep everything organized without getting overwhelmed?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"During school, I've had times when I had multiple assignments due around the same time. I stayed organized by prioritizing what needed to be done first, keeping on track of the deadlines, and focusing on one task at a time so I don't feel overwhelmed."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":246161,"keystrokes":293,"maxInsertChunk":1,"responseDelayMs":49423,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":11,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"That shows a solid foundation for managing priorities and keeping a calm head!\n\nNow letâ€™s look at how that translates into our fast-paced kitchen environment. In our 800-square-foot kiosk, you are working shoulder-to-shoulder with your teammates during peak morning rushes where cars are lined up on both sides of the building. In such a tight space, quick verbal communication and teamwork are critical.\n\n**Imagine you are in the middle of a massive rush, and you suddenly realize you are falling behind on preparing your drinks. How would you handle this in the moment, and how would you communicate with your teammates around you?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"I would stay calm, focus on the most important orders first, and work efficiently with rushing carelessly. I'd communicate with my team members by letting them know I'm falling behind and asking how we can divide the tasks to catch up."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":218060,"keystrokes":265,"maxInsertChunk":2,"responseDelayMs":54533,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":11,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"Speaking up early and asking to redistribute tasks is the best way to keep the line moving smoothly!\n\nNow, let's step into a customer service challenge. \n\nImagine a guest pulls up to your window during a rush, visibly frustrated, and says their iced latte was made with whole milk instead of oat milk, and they're running late for work. \n\n**How would you handle this situation at the window to ensure the customer leaves happy while still keeping the drive-thru line moving quickly?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"I would apologize for the mistake and quickly remake the drink with oat milk. I'd stay calm and friendly, thank them for their patience, and communicate with my team so we can fix the order quickly without holding up the line."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":175919,"keystrokes":252,"maxInsertChunk":1,"responseDelayMs":140632,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":14,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"Handling mistakes with speed, accountability, and a smile is key to turning a customer's day around!\n\nNow, letâ€™s test your real-time multitasking and prioritization with a high-pressure scenario:\n\n**You are operating Window Aâ€™s espresso station. Through your headset, an order for Window B comes in with three complex Lotus Edge energy drinks and two hot grits bowls. Simultaneously, the car right in front of you at Window A honks, asking for napkins.**\n\n**Walk me through your exact thought process to prioritize and execute these tasks step by step.**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"First, acknowledge the honk from window A and say, \"Be right with you.\" Then I would attend to their needs, process window B's order, and return to the headset to confirm and finalize the order."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":157895192,"keystrokes":359,"maxInsertChunk":1,"responseDelayMs":1089896,"tabSwitches":3,"wpm":0,"pasteAttempts":1,"humanConfidence":56}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"That makes a lot of senseâ€”knocking out the quick two-second task (handing over the napkins) immediately clears the distraction at your window so you can fully focus on preparing and coordinating that larger order for Window B!\n\nOur drive-thru opens bright and early to catch the morning commute, with shifts often starting as early as 5:00 AM or 5:30 AM, running through the afternoon and evening, seven days a week.\n\n**What does your general weekly availability look like (days and times), and are you comfortable working early morning shifts and weekends?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"I am available any time, seven days a week. I am comfortable working early morning shifts and weekends."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":96596,"keystrokes":142,"maxInsertChunk":1,"responseDelayMs":85305,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":11,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"Open, flexible availability is huge for a brand-new store openingâ€”thank you for sharing that!\n\nIn a fast-paced drive-thru environment, shift leads and managers often give quick, direct coaching in the moment (like adjusting steam technique, speeding up a step, or correcting a recipe on the fly) to keep speed and quality high. \n\n**How do you typically handle constructive feedback or on-the-spot coaching, and can you share an example of how you've used feedback in the past to improve?**"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"I handle feedback by listening and seeking to understand it. I then focus on making the suggested improvements. For example, my history teacher suggested I make flashcards to study for the test instead of rereading my notes. So, I did it, and it really helped me remember the information for the test."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":494822,"keystrokes":420,"maxInsertChunk":6,"responseDelayMs":60737,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":6,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"That is a great example of taking practical advice and putting it into action right away!\n\nWe have covered all the major aspects of the role, your background, and situational scenarios. \n\n**Do you have any questions for me about the Barista position, the team culture, or what it's like to be part of the new Lehigh Acres Ellianos opening?** *(If not, you can simply let me know you are ready to conclude and submit!)*"}]},{"role":"user","parts":[{"text":"I don't have any questions at the moment. I'm just looking forward to the opportunity to learn, grow, and contribute to the Ellianos coffee team."}],"metrics":{"typingDurationMs":240732,"keystrokes":257,"maxInsertChunk":2,"responseDelayMs":138774,"tabSwitches":0,"wpm":6,"pasteAttempts":0,"humanConfidence":100}},{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"Thank you so much, Victoria! It has been an absolute pleasure speaking with you and learning more about your positive attitude, reliability, and enthusiasm.\n\nYour interview is now complete. Please go ahead and click the **\"Submit\"** button on your screen to finalize your application. \n\nOur hiring team for the Lehigh Acres location will review your responses and be in touch regarding the next steps. Have a fantastic day!"}]}],"status":"Completed","date":"2026-08-24T19:30:18.184Z","position":"Barista","evaluation":"# Candidate Evaluation: Victoria N Cruz-Ortiz\n**Position Applied For:** Barista (Lehigh Acres Location)  \n**Contact:** 239-834-3532 | VictoriaNCruzortiz@gmail.com  \n\n---\n\n### 1. Final Score: 88 / 100\nVictoria presents as a dependable, highly trainable, and customer-oriented entry-level candidate. Her answers demonstrate sound practical logic, calm problem-solving under rush conditions, receptive attitude toward coaching, and completely open availabilityâ€”making her a strong fit for a new store opening.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Key Strengths\n* **Open Availability:** Has 100% flexible availability across all seven days of the week, including early morning opening shifts (5:00 AM/5:30 AM) and weekends.\n* **Calm Prioritization Under Pressure:** Displayed clear, practical logic in high-stress drive-thru scenariosâ€”recognizing the value of quick customer acknowledgment, task division, and active communication when falling behind.\n* **Customer Service & Conflict Resolution:** Showed accountability and a guest-first mindset when resolving order errors (remaking the drink immediately, apologizing sincerely, and maintaining speed of service).\n* **Coachability & Teamwork:** Demonstrated a humble, open attitude toward constructive feedback and peer collaboration.\n* **Reliability Habits:** Proactive approach to punctuality (planning ahead, setting reminders, and factoring in traffic).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Weaknesses & Areas of Concern\n* **Lack of Prior Barista/Food Service Experience:** Most situational examples were drawn from school environments rather than previous retail, hospitality, or fast-paced kitchen roles.\n* **Succinct Responses:** Answers were somewhat brief and generalized, though accurate and aligned with the role's expectations.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Final Recommendation\n**Recommendation:** **Hire** (or proceed with standard In-Person Onboarding/Store Manager Welcome)\n\n*Justification:* For an entry-level drive-thru barista role, open availability, reliable transportation, an eager-to-learn mindset, and basic prioritization logic are paramount. Victoria possesses all the core foundational traits needed to succeed with standard hands-on training.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Authenticity Assessment\n\n* **Average Human-Authorship Confidence:** **96.0%**\n* **Lowest-Confidence Answer:** **Response 9 (56%)**\n* **Answers Below 35% Confidence:** None.\n* **Writing-Style Concordance:** **Agrees with metrics.** Victoriaâ€™s writing style remained consistent, natural, and authentic throughout the entire session. \n\n**Detailed Behavioral Notes:**\n* **Response 9 Observations:** Response 9 covered general schedule availability. The lower confidence metric (56%) was driven by a prolonged session pause / duration (157,895s), 3 tab switches, and a single paste attempt. Given the simple, standard nature of the text (*\"I am available any time, seven days a week...\"*), this indicates the candidate paused/stepped away from the device and returned later, rather than employing generative AI.\n* **Typing Speed & Flow:** Typing speeds were low-to-moderate (6â€“14 WPM) with natural keystroke volumes and realistic response delays across all other responses.\n* **Conclusion:** No indicators of artificial generation or deceptive assistance. All responses reflect genuine human authorship.","id":"0c36107a-f953-4790-be78-ec14ad996021","emailSent":true},{"candidateInfo":{"phone":"2392704734","name":"Nathan Valentine","email":"nathanvalentine10@gmail.com"},"id":"80bd8727-c7b2-4e81-9692-d8926c88698c","secondInterviewGuide":{"interviewerTips":["No asumas un tono acusatorio respecto a los patrones de telemetrÃ­a/pegado; indaga con naturalidad pidiÃ©ndole que desarrolle verbalmente sus ejemplos.","Dado que es su primer empleo, busca evidencia conductual en deportes y proyectos escolares donde haya demostrado consistencia, puntualidad y trabajo bajo presiÃ³n.","EvalÃºa su lenguaje corporal, contacto visual y nivel de energÃ­a fÃ­sica para asegurar que sostendrÃ¡ turnos continuos de pie en horas pico."],"decision":{"hire":"Contratar si el candidato supera con calificaciÃ³n >= 4.0/5.0 los bloques 'mustPass' (1, 2, 3 y 4), demuestra energÃ­a fÃ­sica contagiosa, excelente trato en el roleplay en inglÃ©s, fluidez comunicativa natural y confirma disponibilidad total de 4:00 PM a cierre y fines de semana.","decline":"Descartar si obtiene <= 2.0 en cualquiera de los bloques obligatorios, demuestra intolerancia al feedback correctivo, manifiesta incapacidad para comunicarse con fluidez y calidez en inglÃ©s con los clientes, o si su logÃ­stica de transporte resulta inviable.","thirdConversation":"Considerar una breve llamada de alineaciÃ³n o prueba en barra si demuestra excelente actitud y valores pero muestra timidez extrema en la comunicaciÃ³n verbal o si requiere reajustar los horarios exactos de llegada desde la escuela."},"blocks":[{"id":"block_1","title":"TransiciÃ³n al Primer Empleo y Coachability","goal":"Evaluar la disposiciÃ³n para recibir correcciones operativas en tiempo real y el entendimiento de la responsabilidad laboral.","minutes":10,"mustPass":true,"questionIds":["q1","q2"]},{"id":"block_2","title":"Resistencia FÃ­sica y Multitarea bajo PresiÃ³n","goal":"Verificar si la disciplina deportiva y escolar se traduce efectivamente en agilidad y aguante fÃ­sico dentro de un kiosco de 800 sq ft.","minutes":12,"mustPass":true,"questionIds":["q3","q4"]},{"id":"block_3","title":"InglÃ©s Funcional y SimulaciÃ³n Drive-Thru","goal":"Comprobar la fluidez verbal en inglÃ©s, dicciÃ³n en auricular/headset y capacidad de asesorar clientes con rapidez.","minutes":12,"mustPass":true,"questi